B.akN=new A.aM("IP Study Test generators are a set of questions segregated topic-wise and class-wise to aid the students in the learning process. Our test generators are designed by Subject Matter Experts to benefit students in creating test papers, measuring performance, and identifying topics that need revision. These test generators consist of 50 questions (approx.) including MCQs, Fill in the blanks, Odd one out, One word, Find the Difference, Short Questions, and Long-answer type questions. All IP Study test generators cover all the learning objectives and are meant to test a student\u2019s analytical ability rather than a surface understanding of a subject.",null,B.h_,B.dg,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a6S=new A.a2(B.cS,B.akN,null)
B.ajv=new A.aM("Tests are designed to help learners acquire and retain knowledge about a subject. It consists of a multitude of questions wherein the students have to apply their logical and critical thinking skills to real-life scenarios. Tests encourage learners to self-assessment and recall and apply what they have learned. Our tests can either be taken online or downloaded in pdf form. IP Study tests also provide feedback to the students with test scores and grades and guide them in making progress. Tests also increase focus and speed as students are required to complete the test within the given time limit.",null,B.h_,B.dg,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a6T=new A.a2(B.cS,B.ajv,null)
B.ajO=new A.aM("We strive for excellence in our students and employ learning strategies that foster their growth and development. Our books, practice papers, and tests are written by experts committed to building a strong critical and creative mindset in the students. IP Study\u2019s study material takes into account various factors such as curriculum design, instructional strategy, learning objectives, and student engagement. We also incorporate the latest technology into the learning experience to give students a unique and engaging learning experience and ensure that they stay up-to-date with digital technology. As a team, we are committed to helping students realise their full potential and succeed in life.",null,B.h_,B.dg,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a6U=new A.a2(B.cS,B.ajO,null)
B.aji=new A.aM("IP Study provides multiple practice sets to the students for revision. Our practice sets help students to do quick revisions before the exam, test their knowledge, and identify core areas of improvement. These sets have been designed by experts from the respective fields who have a deeper understanding of the subject, and exam pattern, and are well-versed in the curriculum. By practising IP Study practice tests, students gain more confidence in the subject, perform better and score good grades in exams. These papers engage the students and are great for independent studies..",null,B.h_,B.dg,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a6V=new A.a2(B.cS,B.aji,null)
B.Vq=new A.a_(0,0,4,0)
B.mp=new A.a2(B.Vq,B.yM,null)
B.ajJ=new A.aM("IP Study Practice Papers help students to prepare for their exams and analyse their preparation. Our practice papers are very helpful to the students in scoring good marks in exams of Nursery to K-12, even CBSE Board exams and ICSE Board. These practice papers have been written by SMEs to test the student\u2019s knowledge and are based on the revised NCERT textbooks. Apart from practice questions, our team of experts also provide solutions and detailed explanations of these questions to help teachers and students. These practice papers boost students\u2019 confidence, enhance their understanding, identify knowledge gaps, achieve study targets, and help them manage time-table effectively.",null,B.h_,B.dg,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a6W=new A.a2(B.cS,B.ajJ,null)
B.ajI=new A.aM("Our study materials provide unique and engaging content to students from Nursery to K-12, giving them knowledge at par with the educational standards and leading to their holistic development. IP Study takes a step further with IP Study Practice Papers that help students take a quick revision and test their knowledge on a topic. Once done, the students are also given IP Study test papers such as sample papers and mock tests to give them the confidence to take final or end-term exams.",null,B.h_,B.dg,null,null,null,null,null)
B.a6X=new A.a2(B.cS,B.ajI,null)
B.ajN=new A.aM("Learning games can be an effective way to teach students new concepts and skills because they make learning fun and interactive. By incorporating elements of play into the learning process, students are more likely to stay engaged and motivated, which can lead to better retention of material being taught.",null,B.h_,B.dg,null,null,null,null,null)
